<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Philémon</para>
  <para style="toc1">PHILÉMON</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philémon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Phm</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHILÉMON</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Paul, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:1">Ef 3:1</ref></char></note>prizonye Kris Jésus, ak Timothée, frè nou an: a Philémon, frè byeneme e ouvriye parèy nou an, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />ak Apphia, sè ou, a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:17">Kol 4:17</ref></char></note>Archippe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:25">Fil 2:25</ref></char></note>sòlda parèy a nou, e a legliz lakay ou a: <verse eid="PHM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:7">Wo 1:7</ref></char></note>Lagras pou ou, ak lapè Bondye, Papa nou, e Senyè a, Jésus Kri.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:8">Wo 1:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mwen remèsye Bondye m nan toujou, e nonmen non ou nan lapriyè m yo <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />paske mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:15">Ef 1:15</ref></char></note>tande de lanmou ou, ak lafwa ke ou genyen anvè Senyè a, Jésus, e anvè tout sen yo. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Anplis, mwen priye pou lamitye lafwa ou kapab vin efikas selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:9">Phm 1:9</ref></char></note>konesans a tout bon bagay ki nan ou pou koz a Kris la. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Paske nou gen tan twouve anpil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:4">II Kor 7:4</ref>,<ref loc="2CO 7:13">13</ref></char></note>lajwa ak rekonfò nan lanmou ou, paske kè a fidèl yo vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:18">I Kor 16:18</ref></char></note>rafrechi atravè ou menm, frè.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:12">II Kor 3:12</ref></char></note>malgre ke mwen gen ase konfyans nan Kris pou bay ou lòd pou fè sa ki bon, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />malgre pou koz lanmou an, mwen pito sipliye ou—paske mwen se yon moun tankou Paul <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 2:2">Tit 2:2</ref></char></note>granmoun lan, e koulye a, osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:1">Phm 1</ref></char></note>yon prizonye a Kris Jésus. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Mwen sipliye ou, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:14">I Kor 4:14</ref></char></note>pitit mwen an, Onésime, ke mwen te vin fè pandan mwen te nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:9">Kol 4:9</ref></char></note>prizon an, <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />ke avan, te initil a ou menm, men koulye a, li itil ni pou ou, ni pou mwen.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Mwen voye li tounen kote ou an pèsòn. Sa vle di, se kè m menm ke m voye a. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Mwen te pito kenbe l avè m, pou l ta kapab, nan non ou, fè sèvis pou mwen, pandan mwen anprizone pou levanjil la.<verse eid="PHM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Men san pèmisyon ou, mwen pa t vle fè anyen, pou bonte ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:7">II Kor 9:7</ref></char></note>pa ta, anfèt “pa lafòs”, men m ta pito akoz bòn volonte pa ou. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Paske, li ka petèt separe de ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:5">Jen 45:5</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:8">8</ref></char></note>eksprè pou rezon sa a, pou yon ti tan, pou ou ta kapab genyen l vin retounen nèt, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />pa tankou yon esklav ankò, men plis ke yon esklav <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:8">Mat 23:8</ref></char></note>yon frè byeneme, sitou pou mwen menm, men plis ankò pou ou, nan lachè e nan Senyè a.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Si, konsa, ou gade mwen kòm yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:23">II Kor 8:23</ref></char></note>ouvriye parèy ou, aksepte li kòm ou ta aksepte mwen. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Men si, nan nenpòt jan li te fè ou tò, oswa dwe ou yon bagay, mete sa sou kont mwen. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:21">I Kor 16:21</ref></char></note>Mwen, Paul, mwen ap ekri sa avèk pwòp men mwen. Mwen va ranbouse ou li (annou pa menm pale ke ou menm dwe m menm pwòp tèt ou tou.)<verse eid="PHM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Wi, frè m, kite m benefisye de ou nan Senyè a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:7">Phm 1:7</ref></char></note>Rafrechi kè m nan Kris la. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:3">II Kor 2:3</ref></char></note>Avèk konfyans nan obeyisans ou, mwen ekri ou, paske m konnen ke ou va fè menm plis ke sa mwen di a.<verse eid="PHM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />An menm tan an tou, prepare pou mwen yon kote pou m rete, paske mwen gen espwa ke pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:11">II Kor 1:11</ref></char></note>lapriyè ou yo pou mwen, y ap lage m nan men ou.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol 1:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Épaphras, prizonye parèy mwen nan Kris Jésus, salye ou <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref></char></note>Marc, Aristarque, Démas <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref></char></note>Luc, ouvriye parèy a mwen yo.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 6:18">Gal 6:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ke lagras Senyè a, Jésus Kri, rete avèk lespri ou. Amen.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>